item.description:
Intro =&gt;
Hey there! It&rsquo;s been a month since I started working on Pitivi and here&rsquo;s my progress.
More precise audio waveform Pitivi now produces 5x more detailed waveforms for audio (MR not yet merged). These are the some snaps of before and after (top &amp; bottom respectively). If you have any suggestions or ideas for improving the audio preview then please do mention them here. We would love to hear it!
